OL,3,GNEWSABurnham calls summit of Welsh,
OL,4,AScottish and Northern Irish first
OL,5,Aministers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister also said he was
OL,8,F"open to the conversation" about
OL,9,Fhanding control of policing in Wales to
OL,10,Fthe Welsh government and the Senedd.
